* Constant On-Time Lab -- retriggerable-level one-shot abstractions
* The internal timer is a capacitor charged by an eligible request and then
* discharged by a controlled current. One volt on TONCMD represents 1 second.

.MODEL SW_SHOT_COTLAB VSWITCH (RON=10 ROFF=1G VON=0.7 VOFF=0.3)
.MODEL D_SHOT_COTLAB D (IS=1n N=1 RS=1m TT=1n CJO=1p)

* COT_ONESHOT REQ INHIBIT Q READY
* A level request may retrigger after the minimum-off lockout. INHIBIT aborts
* the active pulse. TON is measured from STARTFRAC*VLOGIC down to VTH.
.SUBCKT COT_ONESHOT REQ INHIBIT Q READY PARAMS:
+ TON=800n TOFFMIN=100n VLOGIC=1 VTH=1m STARTFRAC=0.99
+ CTIMER=100p COFF=10p
VHI VHI 0 {VLOGIC}
EREQ REQ01 0 VALUE={LIMIT(V(REQ)/VLOGIC,0,1)}
EINH INH01 0 VALUE={LIMIT(V(INHIBIT)/VLOGIC,0,1)}
* Do not let a held request precharge TIMER while an inhibit abort is active.
* CHARGE01 is the normalized Boolean request AND NOT inhibit condition.
ECHARGE CHARGE01 0 VALUE={IF(V(INH01)>0.5,0,V(REQ01))}
* OFFLOCK is held high during a pulse, then decays to the READY threshold.
ROFF OFFLOCK 0 {TOFFMIN/(0.693*COFF)}
COFFLOCK OFFLOCK 0 {COFF} IC=0
ESTART START 0 VALUE={IF(V(TIMER)>STARTFRAC*VLOGIC,VLOGIC,0)}
SSTART VHI OFFLOCK START 0 SW_SHOT_COTLAB
SHOLD VHI OFFLOCK QRAW 0 SW_SHOT_COTLAB
EREADY READY 0 VALUE={IF(V(OFFLOCK)<VLOGIC/2,VLOGIC,0)}
* The charge gate and READY switch implement REQ AND NOT INHIBIT AND READY.
SREQ VHI NCHARGE CHARGE01 0 SW_SHOT_COTLAB
SREADY NCHARGE TIMER READY 0 SW_SHOT_COTLAB
CTIME TIMER 0 {CTIMER} IC=0
GDIS TIMER 0 VALUE={IF(V(TIMER)>VTH,
+ CTIMER*(STARTFRAC*VLOGIC-VTH)/TON,0)}
SABORT TIMER 0 INH01 0 SW_SHOT_COTLAB
DCLAMPH TIMER VHI D_SHOT_COTLAB
DCLAMPL 0 TIMER D_SHOT_COTLAB
EQRAW QRAW 0 VALUE={IF(V(OFFLOCK)>VLOGIC/2,
+ IF(V(TIMER)>VTH,VLOGIC,0),0)}
EQ Q 0 VALUE={IF(V(INH01)>0.5,0,V(QRAW))}
RQ Q 0 1G
RREADY READY 0 1G
.ENDS COT_ONESHOT

* Dynamic-command form. TONCMD is clamped to TONMIN..TONMAX. The RC/switch
* trigger latency is not included in the commanded duration.
.SUBCKT COT_ONESHOT_CMD REQ INHIBIT TONCMD Q READY PARAMS:
+ TONMIN=100n TONMAX=2u TOFFMIN=100n VLOGIC=1 VTH=1m
+ STARTFRAC=0.99
+ CTIMER=100p COFF=10p
VHI VHI 0 {VLOGIC}
EREQ REQ01 0 VALUE={LIMIT(V(REQ)/VLOGIC,0,1)}
EINH INH01 0 VALUE={LIMIT(V(INHIBIT)/VLOGIC,0,1)}
ECHARGE CHARGE01 0 VALUE={IF(V(INH01)>0.5,0,V(REQ01))}
ETON TONLIM 0 VALUE={LIMIT(V(TONCMD),TONMIN,TONMAX)}
ROFF OFFLOCK 0 {TOFFMIN/(0.693*COFF)}
COFFLOCK OFFLOCK 0 {COFF} IC=0
ESTART START 0 VALUE={IF(V(TIMER)>STARTFRAC*VLOGIC,VLOGIC,0)}
SSTART VHI OFFLOCK START 0 SW_SHOT_COTLAB
SHOLD VHI OFFLOCK QRAW 0 SW_SHOT_COTLAB
EREADY READY 0 VALUE={IF(V(OFFLOCK)<VLOGIC/2,VLOGIC,0)}
SREQ VHI NCHARGE CHARGE01 0 SW_SHOT_COTLAB
SREADY NCHARGE TIMER READY 0 SW_SHOT_COTLAB
CTIME TIMER 0 {CTIMER} IC=0
GDIS TIMER 0 VALUE={IF(V(TIMER)>VTH,
+ CTIMER*(STARTFRAC*VLOGIC-VTH)/V(TONLIM),0)}
SABORT TIMER 0 INH01 0 SW_SHOT_COTLAB
DCLAMPH TIMER VHI D_SHOT_COTLAB
DCLAMPL 0 TIMER D_SHOT_COTLAB
EQRAW QRAW 0 VALUE={IF(V(OFFLOCK)>VLOGIC/2,
+ IF(V(TIMER)>VTH,VLOGIC,0),0)}
EQ Q 0 VALUE={IF(V(INH01)>0.5,0,V(QRAW))}
RQ Q 0 1G
RREADY READY 0 1G
.ENDS COT_ONESHOT_CMD
